# Reference material and scratch — deliberately never committed.
# Celik/ holds the original Čelik prototype plus the real NPRS-3/NPRS-4
# documents and hand-tuned Mionica templates: citizen-facing forms that
# may carry real voter data, and MUP's CelikApi binaries, which are not
# ours to redistribute. temp/ is scratch output (RIK spreadsheets, logs,
# repro scripts). Both were swept into a commit once by `git add -A`;
# ignoring them makes that mistake impossible to repeat.
Celik/
temp/
instructions-oik-changelog.md

# Local debug logs and Office lock files — never commit
biracki_odbor/new forms/debug/
~$*
